"_PWM=10e3% PWM frequency\nfs=10e3 % controller sam[ple freq (Hz)\nTs=1/fs \nf"
"sp=1e3 % sample frequency speed controller\nTsp=1/fsp\nwb=100 % speed loop ba"
"ndwidth (rad/s)\n%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%\nid_Rs=1.0% id injection current (A)"
"\n%EMsynergy IM change to singlephase\nLsig=6.22e-3 % Leakage inductance (4 p"
"aram model)\nLd=Lsig\nLq=Lsig\nLM= 30e-3 % Magnetzing inductance\nRs=1.84\nRR"
"=1.08\np=2 % pole pair\nPsi_M = 30e-3 % Rotor flux (Wb) at id=1 A\nJ=0.07e-3 "
